---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';

const { entity } = site.legal;
---

<LegalLayout
  eyebrow="Legal"
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  subtitle={`The rules that govern your use of the ${site.name} platform, website and services.`}
>
  <p>
    These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the {site.name} website,
    mobile applications and related services (together, the "Platform"), operated by {entity}
    ("{site.name}", "we", "us" or "our"). By accessing or using the Platform, you agree to be bound
    by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Platform.
  </p>

  <h2>1. About the service</h2>
  <p>
    {site.name} is an online marketplace that connects customers who require device repair services
    with independent, verified repair technicians ("Technicians" or "Partners"). We facilitate
    discovery, live quoting, booking, payment collection and dispute resolution. Repairs are
    performed by independent Technicians, not by {site.name} itself.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must be at least 18 years old and legally capable of entering into binding contracts.</li>
    <li>You must provide accurate, current and complete information when using the Platform.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and any
      one-time passwords (OTPs) issued to you.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Accounts and authentication</h2>
  <p>
    Access to most features requires signing in with a mobile number verified through a one-time
    password. You agree to provide a valid mobile number that you control and to keep your account
    information accurate. You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Quotes, bookings and pricing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A repair request you submit may be broadcast to verified Technicians located near you.</li>
    <li>Technicians respond with quotes that may specify the part grade (Original, OEM or
      Compatible), price, warranty and estimated turnaround.</li>
    <li>Prices are set by the Technicians. {site.name} does not determine the price of any repair.</li>
    <li>A booking is confirmed only when you accept a specific quote and hand over the device.</li>
    <li>Where a repair requires inspection before a final price can be quoted, the Technician will
      notify you and seek your approval for any revised price before proceeding.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Payments</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Payments are processed through secure third-party payment gateways. By paying, you also
      agree to the terms of the relevant payment service provider.</li>
    <li>Amounts may be held securely and released to the Technician only after you confirm that the
      repair has been completed to your satisfaction, in accordance with our
      <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</li>
    <li>You agree to pay all applicable charges, including any applicable taxes, for services you
      book through the Platform.</li>
    <li>{site.name} is not responsible for any fees charged by your bank or payment provider.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Technician obligations</h2>
  <p>
    Technicians are independent third parties and are solely responsible for the repairs they
    perform, the parts they supply, the warranties they issue and compliance with all applicable
    laws. Technicians are required to complete identity and business verification before they may
    quote or accept jobs. {site.name} does not itself perform repairs and is not a party to the
    repair contract between you and a Technician.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Cancellations and refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Cancellations and refunds are governed by our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Cancellation
    Policy</a>, which forms part of these Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Warranty</h2>
  <p>
    Each repair may carry a warranty offered by the Technician against the specific part fitted.
    The warranty period and scope are stated with the relevant quote. Warranty claims are handled
    between you and the Technician, with {site.name} providing reasonable assistance through its
    support and dispute-resolution process.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the Platform for any unlawful, fraudulent or misleading purpose.</li>
    <li>Post false, abusive, defamatory or infringing content.</li>
    <li>Attempt to interfere with, reverse-engineer or gain unauthorised access to the Platform.</li>
    <li>Circumvent the Platform to transact with a Technician in order to avoid applicable charges.</li>
    <li>Impersonate any person or misrepresent your affiliation with any entity.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>10. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    All content, trademarks, logos, software and materials on the Platform are owned by or licensed
    to {entity} and are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. You may not copy,
    reproduce, distribute or create derivative works without our prior written consent.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Disclaimers</h2>
  <p>
    The Platform is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. While we take reasonable steps
    to verify Technicians, {site.name} does not warrant that any Technician's work will meet your
    expectations, and we disclaim all warranties to the fullest extent permitted by law, except as
    expressly stated in these Terms or our policies.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the maximum extent permitted by law, {site.name} shall not be liable for any indirect,
    incidental, special or consequential damages, or for loss of data, profits or goodwill, arising
    out of or in connection with your use of the Platform. Our aggregate liability shall not exceed
    the amount paid by you for the specific transaction giving rise to the claim.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Indemnity</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to indemnify and hold harmless {site.name}, {entity} and their officers, directors,
    employees and agents from any claims, losses, liabilities and expenses arising from your breach
    of these Terms or your misuse of the Platform.
  </p>

  <h2>14. Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    The Platform may integrate or link to third-party services, including payment gateways,
    messaging services and map providers. Your use of those services is subject to their own terms
    and privacy policies, and {site.name} is not responsible for their content or practices.
  </p>

  <h2>15. Suspension and termination</h2>
  <p>
    We may suspend or terminate your access to the Platform at any time if you breach these Terms or
    if we reasonably believe your use poses a risk to other users, Technicians or the Platform.
  </p>

  <h2>16. Changes to these Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by an updated
    "Last updated" date, and continued use of the Platform after such changes constitutes
    acceptance of the revised Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>17. Governing law and jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Subject to applicable law, the courts at Raipur,
    Chhattisgarh shall have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising out of or in connection
    with these Terms or the Platform.
  </p>

  <h2>18. Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    For any questions about these Terms, contact {entity} at
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or {site.contact.phone}, or
    write to us at {site.legal.address.line1}, {site.legal.address.locality},
    {site.legal.address.region} {site.legal.address.postalCode}, {site.legal.address.country}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
